    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "2",
      "description": "<p>Once per day, a jaggerdbrier hag can cause a cage built of cold iron fingernails to spring out of nothingness at a range of up to 30 feet, attempting an Athletics check to [[/act grapple]] against the target's Fortitude DC; if the target has a weakness to cold iron, the jaggerdbrier hag gains a +2 circumstance bonus to this check.</p>\n<p>Unlike a normal Grapple, the jaggerdbrier hag doesn't need to be within reach and can move as she pleases, and a successful attempt lasts until the creature [[/act escape dc=25]]{Escapes} (DC 25), causing the cage to crumble into rust.</p>\n<p>Any creature can attempt to destroy the cage by attacking it. It has an AC of 19, Hardness 10, and 40 Hit Points.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Bonds of Iron",
      "requirements": null,
